WEBVTT

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:57.430
No! I can't see what's in front of me!

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.260
Dance.
Dance, you.

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.590
Here now, Jun.

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:09.040
I believe I told you to serve
Assam tea with financiers.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.540
Go make a fresh pot.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:15.380
And use the proper water temperature.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.000
I can't see! No!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.590
Why are you guys in my room
like it's perfectly normal?

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.850
I'm totally sick of this!

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:31.310
Oh, but my servant's
belongings are mine.

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:33.230
My belongings are also mine.

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:39.900
Jeez, she's totally
back to her old ways.

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.400
Found you!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:48.310
I've finally found them, I guess?

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:53.310
I've finally, finally done it,
I guess, Pizzicato?

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:57.940
Overcoming 36 failures,
I've located them at last!

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.320
I never expected to find
four of them together.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:04.050
Well, crybaby Hina-Ichigo
will be easy...

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:06.830
...and the hot-tempered
Suiseiseki's no match.

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:10.830
Souseiseki and Shinku
might be a bit tough, but...

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:14.020
They're just a gaggle
of chirpy chatterers.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.540
Nothing to worry about!

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.340
Now I'll get four Rosa Mysticas
all at once, I guess?

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:26.710
Their Rosa Mysticas will go to the brainiest
of the Rozen Maidens...

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:32.920
...me, Kanaria, through
easy and dirty means, I guess?

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.010
I've slipped, I guess?

00:03:48.220 --> 00:03:51.240
Kanaria

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.280
I panicked a bit, I guess?

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:04.370
But Kana isn't one to get
discouraged so easily.

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:10.270
First, to steal the Rosa Mysticas,
I'll have to sneak into that house.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:13.190
Now, where's my point of entry?

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:16.910
What's this?

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:26.600
Impossible.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:30.210
Could they have figured out my splendid,
intellectual strategy?

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.710
They're formidable.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.700
Shinku-chan's here...

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:42.020
I don't think we need to lock up
so tightly, do you?

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:43.020
That's naive.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:46.620
It's because they're
here that we have to.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.030
If by chance, a burglar gets in,
who knows what they'll do?

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.030
A burglar in this house?

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:02.100
Get him!

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:03.470
Sheesh...

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:09.640
Sounds fun.

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:10.680
It's not.

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:16.550
They're going out?
That's why?

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:18.520
O-Of course!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.570
There's no way
they'd catch on to my plan!

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:26.060
Which means if my reasoning is correct,
the front door will open!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:30.840
In other words, I'll be able to sneak
in the door then, I guess?

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:34.140
Of course! Of course!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:36.050
It has to be, of course!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.290
I've slipped again, I guess?

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.080
Well, I'll be going.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:45.720
See you later.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:50.270
Jun, Suiseiseki's picking on me!

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:51.480
I am not.

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:55.580
It's puny Ichigo who tied
my lace in a weird way.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.360
See? See?

00:05:57.360 --> 00:05:59.010
You did that yourself!

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:01.200
Suiseiseki, you nincompoop!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:05.370
If I'm a nincompoop, you are trash!

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.520
Oh, okay, okay.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.370
Later.

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:11.240
Now's our chance, Pizzicato.

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.940
Sheesh, they make such a racket
every single morning.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:22.900
T-This is what I anticipated.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.800
There's another human.

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:27.690
Which means the door should open again!

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.920
If I watch for that...

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.300
I'm going now!

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:45.070
Uh-oh!

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:46.280
M-My glasses...

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.120
My glasses...

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.340
W-W-Where is it?

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:56.080
Oh. My, that was very kind of you...

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.090
Oh?

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.090
I'm not done yet!

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.720
If I ring the doorbell,
they should open the door!

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:13.330
This is the perfect plan, I guess?

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:24.340
That's strange.

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.180
I wonder if they didn't hear it.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:51.620
Unyuu, someone's calling...

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:53.140
You mustn't answer it.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:56.090
More importantly,
I'd like some more tea.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:58.180
How persistent!

00:07:58.180 --> 00:07:59.880
How annoying!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.110
Today will mark my 48th time.

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:07.310
Sakurada-san, this time...

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:09.120
This time for sure, I'll...

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.820
What could they be thinking?

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:18.340
It's polite to open up
when the doorbell rings!

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:21.130
Hurry up and answer quickly!

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:43.980
Serves you right.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.410
Oh, I feel better.

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.680
W-Why?

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:56.000
That was close, I guess?

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.500
But Kana isn't one to
back down so easily!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.000
What? Really?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.280
Oh?

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.290
I-I have no choice in
this case, I guess?

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:26.190
Souseiseki.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:30.410
There was a time when Shinku
wanted tea here...

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:31.820
Huh?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.100
The flap...

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:34.670
How careless.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.410
Windows should be closed properly.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.330
Souseiseki! Puny Ichigo!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:42.670
Time for snacks!

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:45.340
Get your butts down here!

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.240
Okay!

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.450
I'm coming!

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:50.390
Come on!
Souseiseki, you hurry too!

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:51.420
Right.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.950
Pizzicato?

00:09:57.390 --> 00:10:00.000
Pizzicato, where are you?

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:08.900
Pizzicato!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:12.370
You sort of smell, I guess?

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:19.880
But with this, I've finally managed
to sneak into the residence!

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.380
Shinku!

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:22.880
Hina-Ichigo!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.380
Suiseiseki!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:25.880
Souseiseki!

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:28.890
Are you prepared?

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:33.100
You're about to experience
true terror now!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.460
Sniff, sniff.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:11.560
This is definitely Robber Cat's hideout!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.160
Where is he?

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.210
Sniff, sniff.

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.210
Robber Cat, where are you?

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.710
Kun-kun, behind you!
Behind you!

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:35.160
Watch out! Kun-kun!

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.820
This duel isn't over.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.370
Hang in there!

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.720
Don't give up, Kun-kun!

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:42.160
This will be your grave, meow.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.350
I knew I'd find you here, Robber Cat!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:45.700
You're all such kids.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:49.820
Getting so caught up over
a mere dog in a puppet show.

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:47.660
Take this!

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:51.840
Oh, Kun-kun's...

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:53.470
I'm not done.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.720
They look so intense.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:59.770
What could they be watching?

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:00.800
Kun-kun, hang in there!

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:03.280
I can't see...

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:09.180
Why don't I investigate
the residence now?

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.570
Y-You're right!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:14.100
I was about to say
the same thing, I guess?

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:17.190
Cast
Kun-kun: Kyousei Tsukui
Robber Cat: Ikkei Seta

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.190
Puppet Art: Masafumi Tamura
Puppet Performance: Yukihiko Nakao
Production Manager: Fushu 56
Puppet Troupe: Nomad

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:21.900
Stare...

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:26.330
Honestly, it's just a made-up story.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:28.700
Watching so intently is useless.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.990
H-H-H-H-He's here!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.960
It's the thief Robber Cat!

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:48.950
H-H-He's come to steal
my precious belongings!

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:50.460
Suiseiseki!

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:54.360
Calm down, Suiseiseki.

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:56.190
It was just the door creaking open.

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:57.700
Wait.

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.370
The door should've
been fully shut.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:03.300
I closed it with my own hands,
so there's no mistake.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:07.980
Then why is it open now?

00:13:08.480 --> 00:13:11.360
There was no wind that
could've opened it.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:12.610
Which means...

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:13.710
You don't mean...

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:17.150
There is someone inside this house.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.450
Someone other than us.

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:28.430
Library

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:33.430
Substitute 3 for x,
and y comes out to be -2, huh?

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.030
Correct.

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:41.360
So you've already gotten
this far in math.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.560
Sarcasm?

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:44.410
Oh, I was impressed.

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:47.170
But I'm not there yet.

00:13:47.170 --> 00:13:48.650
I have to learn to apply it too.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.150
W-What?

00:13:53.150 --> 00:13:54.760
What's so funny?

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:58.890
I-I'm sorry, but that...

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.860
When did they do that?

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:07.730
Jeez, what are those guys thinking?

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:11.420
When I get home, they're in
for some serious punishment.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:13.650
I swear...

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.470
Are they really minding the house?

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.180
Wow...

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:25.810
Shinku, that's amazing!

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:28.250
When did you get that?

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:29.890
Is that the illusive...

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:34.980
Kun-kun dress-up set!

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:40.390
You're just like Kun-kun!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.400
I won it in a contest.

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:48.120
As I thought, there's an invisible bond
between Kun-kun and me.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.410
You sent in the post card.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:56.210
Well then, we're setting off
in search of the intruder right away.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:57.600
Yeah!

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:04.450
Could this be their room?

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:07.320
It's awfully plain.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:16.830
We'll start here.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.830
No one here.

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.200
Let's go.

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:23.810
Oh, wait!

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:24.840
Hina's little pouch!

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.240
Look at the bookshelf!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.850
The line's being crossed!

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:35.720
Which means there's no doubt
someone was in here!

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:41.280
Investigating requires the power
to notice the smallest of clues.

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:43.720
That's what Kun-kun says.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:46.630
Souseiseki, you're amazing...

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:50.810
I'm so proud as your elder twin sister!

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:53.000
You're nothing like that
phony detective we know.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.360
The clues end here!

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.500
Let's search elsewhere!

00:15:58.980 --> 00:15:59.950
Okay!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:01.510
Roger that!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.420
See here! I'm the leader!

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.090
Don't take charge without permission!

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.220
T-That hurt, I guess?

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:26.260
Plus, did they notice I'm here?

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.980
We didn't find any clues.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:31.150
Where is the enemy?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.410
For now, it's time for afternoon tea.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:35.570
Hina-Ichigo,
put the kettle on.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:36.750
Okay!

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:45.950
That sound...

00:16:45.950 --> 00:16:47.880
T-They've finally appeared!

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:48.590
Let us go.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:52.960
Oh, Hina's coming too!

00:16:58.460 --> 00:16:59.760
Just watch.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:02.450
I shall capture
the intruder without fail.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.740
As a Rozen Maiden.

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.570
Hina will do her best too!

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.900
How strange.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:12.260
I thought the sound came from here.

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:13.830
Let's go elsewhere.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:15.300
Yeah!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.230
That was another close call, I guess?

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.030
Safe, I guess?

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:32.510
We'll move on.

00:17:32.510 --> 00:17:33.580
Yeah!

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:40.940
This is starting to go
completely wrong, I guess?

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.220
This isn't coming off at all...

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.170
Damn them...

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:49.330
Just wait and see what
I'll do when I get home...

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:09.540
Are your studies progressing, meow?

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:14.580
If all you do is study every day,
a person will waste away.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:19.310
It might be better to forget it
sometimes and go have fun.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.570
I can't exactly do that.

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:23.910
I'm behind everyone
by a lot.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.810
I see. I see.

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.310
You seem to have a lot of work.

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:42.660
You're a good girl.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:55.930
Incredible...

00:18:58.600 --> 00:18:59.980
There was a weird noise.

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:01.300
From the second floor!

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.280
Let's go.

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:12.070
They fell for it, I guess?

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:15.360
While Pizzicato acts as
bait, I'll set a trap!

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:18.320
A truly ultimate and perfect mission!

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:21.500
Oh, how splendid you are, Kana!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.670
Could this be an emergency?

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:28.940
That voice!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.560
From the living room!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.590
No way.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:34.050
We've been outsmarted!

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.260
Eek! Calm down!
Calm down, Kana!

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.060
You use water for this!

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:41.200
No, you don't use water with gas!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:44.060
Or rather, is the stuff that's burning
a paper towel?

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.350
T-This is bad!

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:48.560
We have to put out the fire quickly!

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:50.800
Leave it to me!

00:19:56.940 --> 00:20:01.460
Unyuu, it's all burnt and wet.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.610
I suppose I have no choice.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:28.930
This is...

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.040
It seems we've prevented a disaster.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.680
Thank goodness.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.940
It's not good at all!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:40.180
This happened because
you left the burner on to start with!

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:41.760
Reflect upon what you did!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.180
Unyuu, I'm sorry.

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:46.130
Ahem!

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:50.060
There's no helping my
discovery, I guess?

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.920
Long time no see,
ladies and ladies!

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:55.460
Who are you?

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:57.500
I guess? It's me!

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.930
It's me, I guess?

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:02.140
Oh, you're Kanaria.

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:04.230
Now that you mention it...

00:21:04.230 --> 00:21:06.000
There was that one.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:06.940
Yay!

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.300
Long time no see, Crab Butter!

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:15.210
Shinku, you okay?

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:16.620
What?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.210
"What?" The ring just...

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.720
T-T-There's another one!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:25.760
She's a Rozen Maiden doll like us.

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:26.840
Ka...

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:27.840
Ka...

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.720
Kanagawa!

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.460
Kanaria!

00:21:33.030 --> 00:21:34.470
Never mind her name.

00:21:34.470 --> 00:21:36.950
Explain what's going on here!

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:39.470
Don't be in such an uproar over it.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:43.470
It's just that now all
of the dolls are present.

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:44.970
That is all.

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:57.120
Yes, they are all present now.

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:07.280
The real Alice Game...

00:22:08.170 --> 00:22:09.690
...begins now.

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:47.140
Honestly, that puny human stole
Suiseiseki's pudding again!

00:23:47.140 --> 00:23:49.800
Hold on, that was Jun-kun's snack.

00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:51.260
Shut up!

00:23:51.260 --> 00:23:54.230
The puny human's
belongings are mine.

00:23:54.230 --> 00:23:55.660
That's absurd.

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:58.530
But it shows just how much
you think about him.

00:23:59.030 --> 00:24:00.930
Where did that come from?

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:03.210
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:06.140
Its melody is so like a dream.

00:24:04.030 --> 00:24:10.880
Chapter 4
Covenant
